('shared_kernel/obstruction.py',97,'Obstruction hints are declared IDs/family/descriptions, not detected mathematical obstructions. ObstructionFamily declares VALID_FAMILIES but inherits Kind validation without checking membership, unlike Role. from_dict stringifies raw fields, weakening annotated input types; missing keys still raise.'),
('shared_kernel/regime.py',88,'Regime normalizes case/whitespace and enforces the declared finite set of execution-regime labels. The selected label does not implement or verify undecidability, observation, a normalizer, code/research ownership or finite-library restrictions; those remain caller responsibilities.'),
