('shared_kernel/required_reply_fields.py',73,'Required fields are normalized through FieldName and sorted/deduplicated. validate_reply checks key inclusion only, not types/values, exact equality of key sets or semantics; an explicitly empty required set passes every reply. Defaults list seven labels but callers can deliberately choose another set.'),
('shared_kernel/demand_item.py',58,'Demand item ties nominal demand/target IDs to description and serializes them. from_dict coerces every raw value to string with default description, so it is a convenience decoder rather than strict schema validation. No referenced obstruction existence or demand derivation is checked.'),
