('shared_kernel/kind.py',124,'Generic Kind normalizes case/whitespace and permits any bounded syntactic token. Role explicitly calls base validation and then enforces the seven-role set, handling slotted dataclass inheritance correctly. Role names designate participants only, not authenticated identities or capabilities.'),
